{"1123990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Akeno no Yosuga - Twilight Loop", "steam_appid": 1123990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >『アケノヨスガ - Twilight Loop -』 is a loop-based psychological horror visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day at 5 PM, a girl named Akane dies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, Keita, becomes aware of this loop and struggles to change her fate.<br>However, no matter what choices he makes, her death is inevitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story unfolds, a shocking truth emerges—<br>Akane has been dying repeatedly to protect Keita.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Themes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fate and inevitability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Self-sacrifice and distorted love</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror and emotional breakdown</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you accept the truth, or defy it?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >『アケノヨスガ - Twilight Loop -』 is a loop-based psychological horror visual novel.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every day at 5 PM, a girl named Akane dies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist, Keita, becomes aware of this loop and struggles to change her fate.<br>However, no matter what choices he makes, her death is inevitable.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the story unfolds, a shocking truth emerges—<br>Akane has been dying repeatedly to protect Keita.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Themes:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fate and inevitability</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Self-sacrifice and distorted love</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psychological horror and emotional breakdown</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you accept the truth, or defy it?</p>", "short_description": "She keeps dying in your place. Can you break the loop?", "supported_lan